    "note": "Hand-curated source for the Games Workshop Warhammer Tone Pro range (released 2026-10-24): 30 colour families x 5 numbered tones (1 = darkest, 5 = lightest) = 150 paints, 12 ml pots. hobby-desk-data (our canonical upstream, pinned 1bc4e09) predates the range. Family names and per-tone hex swatches are taken from FauxHammer's 'Ultimate Guide to Warhammer Tone Pro' (https://www.fauxhammer.com/reviews/paints/ultimate-guide-warhammer-tone-pro/, dateModified 2026-10-10), whose hexes are sampled from GW's published colour charts, not from wet paint; all 150 values were extracted and every duplicate occurrence on the page agreed. Family list cross-checked against Loaded Dice and Tale of Painters. The two mediums (Shading Medium, Blending Medium) have no swatch and are not included.",
    "verified": "2026-11-17"
  },
